        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kui̱ ciek mi ca kuɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth dho̱ri kuayni Gil-yad gat Ma-kir gat Ma-na-thɛ, min la kuɛ̈ɛ̈ Jo-thɛp ben ruac nhiam Muthɛ kɛnɛ bööth, kɛ bööth thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial ji̱ jiök i̱ kämni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl mun kɛ yor gaakni. Kä ci Kuoth Nhial ji̱ lɛni jiök i̱ kämni kui̱ dämaara ni Dhɛ-lɔ-pɛ-ɣadh nyieekɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wakɛ wä kuɛn ɛ gaat thuɔk duëël i̱ dɔ̱ŋ rɛy thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, ba kui̱diɛn naŋ kä kui̱ gua̱nikɔ, ba wä mat kui̱ thuɔk duëël in ba kɛ kuɛn thi̱n. Ba woc kä kui̱c in ci pɛn kä kɔ kɛ gaakni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä ruɔ̱n lucä ŋɔaani wä ben ba kui̱diɛn mat kui̱ thuɔk duëël ɔ bakɛ kuɛn thi̱n ɔ. Ba kui̱diɛn ka̱n kä kui̱ thuɔk duëël gua̱nikɔ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ ruac kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ce̱tnikɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial wee i̱, “Te thok duëël gan Jo-thɛp kɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛmɛ ɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar kɛ kui̱ nyieet Dhɛ-lɔ-pɛ-ɣadh, ‘Akɛ kuɛ̈nkɛ ɛ ram in guic kɛnɛ gɔaa. Kä akɛ kuɛ̈nkɛ thok duëël gua̱ndiɛn kärɔa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö /Ca duŋ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl bi ka̱n thok duëëlɔ ba naŋ thok duëël in dɔ̱ŋ. Kä bi ramɔ kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kui̱c thuɔk duëël gua̱ni tit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nya mi ci kui̱c ka̱n kä thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal, ba ciek ram kɛl thok duëël gua̱n, kɛ ɣöö bi ramɔ ciɛŋ ni kui̱ gua̱n kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ kui̱c mi ba ka̱n wa̱nɔ mi ba naŋ kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ. Bi thok duëël ɔ kä thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kui̱dɛ tit.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nyiee Dhɛ-lɔ-pɛ-ɣadh la̱t ni min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r Muthɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua Maɣ-la kɛnɛ Ti̱r-dha, kɛ Ɔg-la, kɛnɛ Mil-ka kɛ Nowa nyiee Dhɛ-lɔ-pɛ-ɣadh kuɛn ɛ gaat thuɔk duëël gua̱ndiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua kɛ kuɛn ɛ gaat Ma-na-thɛ gat Jo-thɛp, kä cu kui̱diɛn cu te thok duëël gua̱ndiɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tɔ̱tɔ̱ a ŋuɔ̱t tëë ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ la̱t Muthɛ kɛ kui̱ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɛy tɔ̱ɔ̱rä Mo-ab kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn kä Jɛ-ri-ko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
